      "updated": 1794090041437,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Outside data (was the biggest limitation)\nNow: the research step (right, section 5) searches the open web, and the service validates and registers finds.\nThe 10-entry web catalogue stays for curated feeds (IBTrACS, GeoNames).",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
