      "text": "Who works: Claude Opus orchestrates (specs, briefs, review, merge) · Codex CLI workers implement in git worktrees (guard at 72% of the 5-h window; Codex is also the eval agent's LLM)\n· Claude Sonnet builds references and critiques · Haiku for simple tasks.  Web UI: ./run.sh -> http://127.0.0.1:8000/",
